{
  "_doc": "Tier-2 dairy barn across the yard from the Okafor farmhouse (framework farm_okafor, lot 'barn', big doors face the yard). Route: big doors chained from inside -> round the west side where the workshop boards are torn out -> workshop -> the aisle between the stalls (sleepers in the straw; Papa's bear trap) -> feed room: the milk ledger and the tack-room key on the nail (a can chime on the door) -> unlock the tack room: saddles, Papa's chest, the ladder -> up through the hatch into the nest where the thing in the loft lived (loot room; its guardian is home) -> out into the hayloft (ambush; a soft patch of floor) -> drop through the hay hole into the east stalls -> draw the bolt on the stall door and leave. Hollowed don't climb ladders: the loft is the only place the stall sleepers can't follow.",
